OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer found guilty of
OL,4,Araping woman
OL,5,
OL,6,FA West Yorkshire Police officer has
OL,7,Fbeen found guilty of raping a woman.
OL,9,FPC Joe Lavender, who was working in the
OL,10,FLeeds district at the time of his
OL,11,Fsuspension, assaulted the woman in
OL,12,F2002, prior to him joining the force in
OL,13,F2005.
OL,15,FLavender, 45, of Castleford, was found
OL,16,Fguilty by a jury at York Crown Court
OL,17,Fearlier and was bailed ahead of
OL,18,Fsentencing on 3 November.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
