OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer found guilty of
OL,4,Araping woman
OL,5,
OL,6,FWest Yorkshire Police said it would
OL,7,Fcontinue with misconduct proceedings to
OL,8,F"ensure PC Lavender is barred from
OL,9,Fworking in any role in policing in the
OL,10,Ffuture".
